<section class="bio">
  <h1>Ani<span class="surname">rudha Bose</span></h1>
  <p class="now" aria-hidden="true"><span class="ani-verb" id="ani-verb">{{ verbs[0] }}</span>…</p>

  <p>
    I'm a Senior Staff Engineer at <a href="https://brave.com">Brave</a>,
    working on web3 initiatives, mostly
    <a href="https://brave.com/wallet">Wallet</a>. I like building in public,
    and much of what I do is open source.
  </p>

  <p>
    I work where product strategy becomes code, and I spend about
    as much time on what to build as on how to build it. The work I'm proudest
    of is rarely the clever kind. It's usually small, quietly high leverage,
    and pointed at a real person on the other side of the screen.
  </p>

  <p>
    Outside Brave, I think a lot about LLMs, markets, and the craft of
    building startups from zero. I run an engineering and consulting practice through
    <a href="https://21mlabs.com">21M Labs</a>.
  </p>

  <p>
    I started my career in Paris and spent several good years there before
    trading the Seine for Bangalore, where I'm based now.
  </p>

  <p><b>Past lives:</b></p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <a href="https://ledger.com">Ledger</a>: helped secure billions of
      dollars.
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="https://home.cern">CERN</a>: touched the
      <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Large_Hadron_Collider">Large
      Hadron Collider</a>.
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="http://www.hri.res.in">HRI</a>: learned that quantum
      mechanics is hard, and teleportation is real.
    </li>
  </ul>
